Software Validation from Datasets/Evaluation Tool/artifacts/production_release/
Software Validation from Datasets/Evaluation Tool/artifacts/production_setup/
Software Validation from Datasets/Evaluation Tool/artifacts/production_verification/
Software Validation from Datasets/Evaluation Tool/artifacts/pytest_*/
Software Validation from Datasets/Evaluation Tool/artifacts/word_build_*/
Software Validation from Datasets/Evaluation Tool/artifacts/word_qa*/
transfer_packages/

# Machine-local Evaluation Tool outputs. These folders live beside the tool so
# all future research artifacts stay under one managed location without entering Git.
Software Validation from Datasets/Evaluation Tool/JustPeachyGeneratedData/
Software Validation from Datasets/Evaluation Tool/JustPeachyLogs/
Software Validation from Datasets/Evaluation Tool/JustPeachyResearchSummaries/
Software Validation from Datasets/Evaluation Tool/JustPeachyResults/
